-- 1. GG2 · Unit 8 · ДЗ 5 · блок 2 — плакат «Running for fun!» перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>Running for fun! 🏃</h3><p>Для начала внимательно прочитай текст ниже!</p><blockquote><p><b>Do you like running? Yes?<br>Well, why not try these fun events?</b></p><p><b>January: Winter Run!</b></p><ul><li><b>Where is it?</b> Brown Forest</li><li><b>Who can go?</b> Families</li><li><b>What can you do?</b> You can run one or two kilometres. There’s hot soup for the runners after the race! Remember to wear a hat!</li></ul><p><b>March: Fun Races!</b></p><ul><li><b>Where is it?</b> New Park School</li><li><b>Who can go?</b> Children aged 7–12</li><li><b>What can you do?</b> You can run in three races. You can run in an egg and spoon race, a jumping race or a hopping race. There’s a crazy basketball game in gloves in the afternoon.</li></ul><p><b>May: Costume Run!</b></p><ul><li><b>Where is it?</b> Tree Park</li><li><b>Who can go?</b> Children aged 5–14</li><li><b>What can you do?</b> Put on your favourite costume and you can run 50 m, 100 m or 200 m. In the afternoon you can have a picnic with your friends.</li></ul><p><b>Have fun, runners!</b></p></blockquote>$h$::text))
where id = '73d50a2c-9dfc-4151-a38a-f15cc78bfc1f';

-- 2. GG2 · Unit 3 · ДЗ 5 · блок 9 — скан дневника Пенни убран: текст уже набран выше
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>Penny’s holiday diary</h3><p><b>23rd July</b><br>It's day number one of our holiday. We usually go to Spain in the summer. We love it there but this year we're in Corsica, in France. It's a beautiful island!</p><p><b>27th July</b><br>There are white beaches and you can go swimming, windsurfing and sailing. But today I'm swimming in a lake! There are a lot of lakes and rivers here. The longest river is the Golo – it's 90 kilometres long. I want to swim in the lake again but Mum says the sea is better. She doesn't like cold water and the water in the lake is cold!</p><p><b>1st August</b><br>It's a beautiful day. We're walking in the mountains. You can go mountain biking too. I want to go rock climbing but Dad says it's too dangerous.</p><p><b>3rd August</b><br>Today we're in Ajaccio. Ajaccio is next to the sea and it's the coolest town on the island. I love the shops here. It's lunch time now and we're sitting under an umbrella and eating sausages and cheese. Yum!</p>$h$::text))
where id = 'ee45e228-2b82-4e1b-92ec-59c56c8107e4';

-- 3. GG2 · Unit 4 · ДЗ 5 · блок 2 — скан объявления убран: текст уже набран ниже
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<p>Сначала прочитаем текст о рекордах, которые установили ученики одной школы, а потом сделаем по нему несколько заданий.</p><h3>Friday 24th May: School Records Competition</h3><p>What do you think of world records? In my opinion, they are fun and interesting. Well, we have a School Records Competition every year. It is the funniest day of the year! Everyone can join the fun!</p><p><b>These are some records to beat:</b></p><ul><li><b>Thomas Baker:</b> He’s the fastest runner. 100m in 14.4 seconds!</li><li><b>Katie Lancer:</b> She’s the most intelligent student. 19/20 questions correct in 5 minutes.</li><li><b>Mrs Price</b> (our Maths teacher!): Her pizza is the longest of all: 80 centimetres long!</li><li><b>Daniella</b> (Mr Nunn’s pet cat!): She’s the most beautiful pet of all. Bring your photos, not your pets!</li></ul><p>Are you faster, taller, more intelligent or maybe funnier than your classmates? Then come to the School Records Competition and be the best!</p><p>Check out the after school clubs website for all the records you can try. There are a lot of them!</p><p>Contact me: Gordon Butler for forms.</p>$h$::text))
where id = 'db36599e-b046-4df7-aa79-fa96249d5829';

-- 4. SM3 · Unit 4 · ДЗ 4 · блок 9 — открытка Али перебрана текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>Молодец! А теперь прочитай внимательно текст</h3><blockquote><p>Dear Mum and Dad</p><p>It’s day one of our school trip! What a great place! I’m having a lovely time. Our hotel is opposite a park. The hotel is brilliant! Next to it there is a castle. Near the castle there is an old tower in a square. I want to climb it to see the views of the town. I love it here!</p><p>We’re going to the museum in the centre to look at the paintings now. They have some by Da Vinci, Rembrandt and Van Gogh! Have to go!</p><p>Hope you are well</p><p>Love Ali</p></blockquote><p><b>Mr and Mrs Muhtar</b><br>55 East Ninth Street<br>New York<br>NY 10011<br>USA</p>$h$::text))
where id = 'f1ce56d2-baf5-4b03-bf58-45093364e26f';

-- 5. SM3 · Unit 4 · ДЗ 6 · блок 2 — диалог Пола и Дейзи, первая половина
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>Paul and Daisy in town</h3><p><img src="https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/sm3/u4/scene_town_map.webp" alt="План города" style="max-width:360px;width:100%"></p><p><b>Пример:</b></p><p><b>Paul:</b> I think we’re lost.<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A There’s a bus stop opposite the bank.<br>B I think it’s a car park.<br><b>C Let’s look at the map.</b> ✅</p><p><b>Questions</b></p><p><b>1 Paul:</b> Look! Can you see the museum?<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A Yes, it’s near the market square.<br>B It’s a big place.<br>C There’s a café.</p><p><b>2 Paul:</b> OK. Where are we going now?<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A The tower is over there.<br>B It’s above the window.<br>C We’re going to the library.</p><p><b>3 Paul:</b> Why are we going there?<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A To borrow a book about Egypt.<br>B We’re going on Sunday.<br>C It’s a castle.</p>$h$::text))
where id = '85bd3f3e-6f8c-4410-b3c1-58be41bab6c1';

-- 6. SM3 · Unit 4 · ДЗ 6 · блок 3 — диалог Пола и Дейзи, вторая половина
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<p><b>4 Paul:</b> I’m a little hungry.<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A We can go to the sports centre.<br>B We can buy a sandwich at the supermarket.<br>C Let’s go to the funfair.</p><p><b>5 Paul:</b> Oh, no! I haven’t got any money!<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A OK. Let’s go to the bank.<br>B The library isn’t open now.<br>C There’s a park opposite the market square.</p><p><b>6 Paul:</b> What a long day. Where can we get some rest?<br><b>Daisy:</b><br>A Yes, let’s get a salad.<br>B No, it’s not near the market.<br>C Let’s go to the park and sit under a tree.</p>$h$::text))
where id = 'b00eb912-fbe5-4624-bcda-9381bbf005a8';

-- 7. SM3 · Unit 5 · ДЗ 8 · блок 2 — «The Megalodon» перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<p><b>Read the text:</b></p><h3>The Megalodon</h3><p><img src="https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/sm3/u5/megalodon_scale.webp" alt="Megalodon" style="max-width:360px;width:100%"></p><p>There were once many different animals in the water. There were sea birds called great auks and there were the baiji, river dolphins from China. Another extinct animal is the megalodon. These were huge sharks between 14 and 18 metres long. Their teeth were 21 centimetres long! These enormous creatures were very fast swimmers and were in the waters around Europe, Africa, North and South America between 16.1 and 1.6 million years ago. They were carnivores and their favourite food was whales and seals.</p>$h$::text))
where id = '264913d5-4a88-4773-b625-b10fe44bd5c1';

-- 8. SM3 · Unit 5 · ДЗ 8 · блок 9 — образец рассказа про черепах перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>А вот как можно рассказать о морском животном</h3><p><img src="https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/sm3/u5/sea_turtle.webp" alt="Turtle" style="max-width:360px;width:100%"></p><blockquote><p>I like turtles. They are beautiful. They are green, yellow, grey and brown. They live in the sea, rivers or lakes. They eat plants and small animals. Turtles lay eggs on beaches. They put their eggs into the sand. The baby turtles swim. Turtles usually live for 40–70 years, but they can live up to 175 years.</p></blockquote><p>Пригодится на уроке :)</p>$h$::text))
where id = '2cc2c6b0-3b1b-4de6-a6c3-301362750416';

-- 9. SM3 · Unit 7 · ДЗ 7 · блок 2 — «Have you got a healthy lifestyle?» перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>Have you got a healthy lifestyle?</h3><p>Давай вспомним, о чём мы говорили на уроке, и прочитаем текст.</p><p><b>Eating healthy food, doing exercise, and getting fresh air and rest help us to keep healthy.</b></p><ul><li><b>healthy food 🥕</b><br>Try to eat some fruit and vegetables and some bread, pasta or rice every day. Don’t eat a lot of the same food, like chips, pizza or ice cream.</li><li><b>rest 😴</b><br>Rest is also very important. You can rest by doing things like reading a book. The best way to rest is to sleep. That’s why it’s important to get a good sleep every night.</li><li><b>fresh air 🌬️</b><br>Go outside and get some fresh air! You can cycle to school or to a friend’s house.</li><li><b>exercise 🏃</b><br>Try and exercise often to stay strong. Swimming, cycling and doing sports make us healthy. You can exercise with friends.</li></ul>$h$::text))
where id = '831eabb4-9e01-4365-9101-8ef290f9bd07';

-- 10. SM3 · Unit 8 · ДЗ 5 · блок 6 — диалог про еду разных стран перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>In a restaurant …</h3><p><b>Mum:</b> Let’s try some food from Turkey. Would you like some spinach and potatoes?<br><b>Oliver:</b> No, Mum.<br><b>Mum:</b> What about some rice with peas or beans?<br><b>Oliver:</b> I’m not sure. Can I have a hamburger?</p><h3>The next day after school …</h3><p><b>Oliver:</b> Adil, I’m hungry. Let’s get a hamburger.<br><b>Adil:</b> Oliver, I don’t like hamburgers. Come to my house, we can have dinner there.<br><b>Oliver:</b> OK, but I have to phone my mum from your house.</p><h3>At Adil’s house …</h3><p><b>Adil:</b> Yummy! Rice with peas, beans, potatoes and spinach. I hope you like it, Oliver.<br><b>Oliver:</b> Mmm. It’s very good, Mrs Demir.<br><b>Adil’s mum:</b> Thank you, Oliver.</p><h3>Two days later …</h3><p><b>Oliver:</b> Mum, I’m hungry. Can I have some spinach with potatoes, please?</p>$h$::text))
where id = 'e3991284-8415-40ae-8f5a-5db9dffdfdf4';

-- 11. SM3 · Unit 8 · ДЗ 7 · блок 2 — семь чудес: средняя картинка (текст) перебрана, карта и коллаж остались
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>Wonders of the world</h3><p><img src="https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/sm3/u8/reading_wonders_3.webp" alt="Wonders of the world" style="max-width:100%"></p><p><img src="https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/sm3/u8/reading_wonders_1.webp" alt="Карта чудес света" style="max-width:100%"></p><ol><li>Lots of interesting animals, like pink snakes, live in the Grand Canyon. It’s in <b>North America</b>.</li><li>The Harbour of Rio de Janeiro is in <b>South America</b>. There are more than 80 kilometres of beaches next to it.</li><li>The Northern Lights are usually green, red or pink. You can see them in <b>Europe</b>.</li><li>Paricutin Volcano is in <b>North America</b>. It’s 3,170 metres high.</li><li>Mount Everest is more than 60 million years old. It’s in <b>Asia</b>.</li><li>The Great Barrier Reef is in <b>Australasia</b>. More than 1,500 kinds of fish live there.</li><li>Victoria Falls is in <b>Africa</b>. The water comes from the Zambezi river.</li></ol>$h$::text))
where id = '9988528f-2f5f-4a1c-adf1-4e00f6f7ccc5';

-- 12. SM3 · Unit 9 · ДЗ 7 · блок 3 — «100 years ago» перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<h3>At the seaside 100 years ago</h3><p><img src="https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/sm3/u9/old_crowded_beach.webp" alt="Пляж 100 лет назад" style="max-width:360px;width:100%"></p><p>100 years ago, many families went on holiday to the seaside by steam train. The beaches were very crowded with people. People wore special swimming boots in the water but they didn’t wear sunglasses. Children played in the sand and in the water. They liked watching puppet shows and going on donkey rides. Many families had picnic baskets with sandwiches, fruit and lemonade in them for lunch. Sometimes a cart came to the beach with ice cream for people to buy.</p>$h$::text))
where id = '3a5f2af3-9be3-4f7a-bc93-f34e3dc97513';

-- 13. SM3 · Final Test · блок 9 — конец рассказа Джима перебран текстом
update classroom_blocks set payload = jsonb_set(payload, '{html}', to_jsonb($h$<p>Это конец рассказа <b>Джима</b> о своём дне рождения. Прочитай и заполни пропуски в задании ниже. <i>take off — снимать</i></p><blockquote><p>I helped Mum to clean the kitchen and then we sat down and had some more cake there. ‘Where’s Dad?’ I asked Mum. ‘In the living room,’ she said. I went to find Dad but I could only see the clown there. Then I looked at his face. He took off his funny beard, his hair and his glasses and smiled at me. It was Dad!</p><p>‘Thank you, Dad!’ I said. ‘This was the best birthday present.’</p></blockquote>$h$::text))
where id = 'b6cb7a57-77a4-4506-9a01-2568a74f523b';
